        "sendTo": "=info@studexmeat.com, {{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.customerEmail }}",
        "subject": "=New Invoice Generated - {{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.customerName }}",
        "message": "=Dear {{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.customerName }},\n\nPlease find attached your invoice from StudEx Meat.\n\n--- Invoice Summary ---\nInvoice Number: {{ $('QuickBooks - Create Invoice').item.json.DocNumber }}\nDate: {{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.invoiceDate }}\n\nItem: {{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.cut }}\nMarble Score: {{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.marbleScore }}\nWeight: {{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.weight }}kg\nPrice per Cut: R{{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.pricePerCut }}\n\nSubtotal: R{{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.subtotal }}\nVAT (15%): R{{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.tax }}\nGrand Total: R{{ $('Calculate Invoice Totals').item.json.grandTotal }}\n\nPayment is due within 30 days. Please reference the invoice number above in your payment.\n\nThank you for your business.\n\nKind regards,\nStudEx Meat\ninfo@studexmeat.com",
        "options": {
